msgid "Introduction to Geocode GLib"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/gnome/platform/geocode-glib.xml:30
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>Geocode GLib</application> is a convenience library for the"
" Yahoo! Place Finder APIs. The Place Finder web service allows you to do "
"geocoding (finding longitude and latitude from an address), as well as "
"reverse geocoding (finding an address from coordinates)."
msgstr ""

